{
  "_sources": {
    "about": "Formplayer response shapes for Connect Web's tests (Python: tests/fake_formplayer.py; JS: static/connect_web/*.test.js). Field names are taken from the labs-mode Formplayer source, not guessed. Values are made up.",
    "menus": "beans/menus/CommandListResponseBean.java (type 'commands', commands[] = Command.java: index, displayText, audioUri, imageUri, navigationState, badgeText) extends MenuBean (breadcrumbs, locales) extends BaseResponseBean (title, notification, selections, appId, appVersion, persistentMenu).",
    "case_list": "beans/menus/EntityListResponse.java (type 'entities', entities[] = EntityBean.java: id, data[], groupKey, altText; headers[], widthHints[], actions[] = DisplayElement.java: text, pageCount, currentPage, noItemsText, hasDetails, isMultiSelect, usesCaseTiles).",
    "case_details": "beans/menus/EntityDetailListResponse.java: the list is serialised under the JSON key 'details' (@JsonGetter(\"details\")), each an EntityDetailResponse.java: title, headers[], details[] (values), styles, altText.",
    "form": "beans/NewFormResponse.java (session_id via SessionResponseBean @JsonGetter(\"session_id\"), tree[], langs[], breadcrumbs[], title). Each tree node is a QuestionBean.java round-trip of api/json/PromptToJson.java + Walker.java: datatype in {str,int,longint,float,date,time,datetime,select,multiselect,geo,barcode,binary,info}; control = javarosa Constants.CONTROL_* (1 input, 2 select one, 3 select multi, 9 trigger, 10 image choose, 12 audio, 13 video); required 0|1; relevant is always 0 in the serialised bean (irrelevant nodes are simply absent, Walker.walk); style is {raw: appearance} or null; select answers are 1-based ordinals (getTouchformsIndex), multiselect a list of them; date 'yyyy-MM-dd', time 'HH:mm', datetime 'yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZZ', geo [lat, lon]. Groups are type 'sub-group' with children; a repeat instance is a sub-group with repeatable 'true', exists 'true', delete true; the 'add another' dummy is a sub-group with repeatable 'true', exists 'false', 'add-choice' text (PromptToJson.parseQuestionType EVENT_REPEAT / EVENT_PROMPT_NEW_REPEAT). Matches HQ's own spec fixtures (corehq/apps/cloudcare/static/cloudcare/js/form_entry/spec/fixtures.js).",
    "answer": "beans/FormEntryResponseBean.java: status 'accepted' with tree[], or 'validation-error' with type 'required'|'constraint' and reason (JsonActionUtils.questionAnswerToJson); errors{ix: ErrorBean {status, type}}.",
    "submit": "beans/SubmitResponseBean.java: status success|validation-error|error|too-many-requests|case-cycle-error, submitResponseMessage, errors{ix: ErrorBean}, nextScreen, notification (NotificationMessage.java: message, error, type, tag). docs/labs-mode.md 'Submission results'.",
    "exception": "beans/exceptions/ExceptionResponseBean.java via application/GlobalDefaultExceptionHandler.java: HTTP 200 {exception, status:'error', type:'text', url, statusCode}; a gone session is exceptions/FormNotFoundException.java's message.",
    "media_profile": "HQ's media_profile.ccpr: the PostURL property (docs/labs-mode.md 'Which app_id to send')."
  },
